{"unit_id":"pingmike2__dsh-telegram-control#card-zh","repo":"pingmike2/dsh-telegram-control","commit":"8b8c60df33b3612dd6ce0b320c22f03aca4b051c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-telegram-control 是一款面向 Telegram 手机端的 DSH 系统级控制台。它通过 Telegram Bot 长轮询接收文字和命令，并把用户消息交给 DSH 会话处理，再将回答发回聊天。用户可以查看、新建、切换和关注会话，调用 DSH 工具、执行主机命令、读写文件，也能管理插件与 bundle。它还可把工具审批和 agent 提问转成 Telegram 按钮交互，并提供本机配置页和配置热加载。适合需要从 Telegram 管理 DSH 会话的用户；需要配置 Telegram botToken 与用户或聊天 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:732-742","index.js:1474-1557","index.js:2582-3010","index.js:3824-3868","cordis.patch.yml:1-17"]}
{"unit_id":"pingmike2__dsh-telegram-control#card-en","repo":"pingmike2/dsh-telegram-control","commit":"8b8c60df33b3612dd6ce0b320c22f03aca4b051c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-telegram-control lets users manage DSH sessions from Telegram. Chat messages go to a DSH session and agent replies return to the chat. Commands manage sessions, call tools, run host commands, handle approvals, and manage plugins. It requires a Telegram botToken and allowed IDs.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:732-742","index.js:1474-1557","index.js:2582-3010","index.js:3824-3868","cordis.patch.yml:1-17"]}
