{"unit_id":"pingmike2__dsh-telegram-control#feature-sessions","repo":"pingmike2/dsh-telegram-control","commit":"8b8c60df33b3612dd6ce0b320c22f03aca4b051c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-telegram-control 的功能「会话管理」：查看会话列表并创建、切换或关注会话。通过 /sessions、/new、/use 和 /watch 等 Telegram 命令触发，选定会话可接收后续文本消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2651-2772","index.js:3087-3116"]}
{"unit_id":"pingmike2__dsh-telegram-control#feature-remote_prompt","repo":"pingmike2/dsh-telegram-control","commit":"8b8c60df33b3612dd6ce0b320c22f03aca4b051c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-telegram-control 的功能「远程对话」：在绑定的 Telegram 聊天发送普通文本，即可将内容作为 prompt 发给 DSH 会话，并收到 agent 的最终回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1507-1557","index.js:1834-1900"]}
{"unit_id":"pingmike2__dsh-telegram-control#feature-approvals","repo":"pingmike2/dsh-telegram-control","commit":"8b8c60df33b3612dd6ce0b320c22f03aca4b051c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-telegram-control 的功能「审批与提问」：启用接管后，工具审批和符合条件的 agent 提问会显示为 Telegram 内联按钮，也可直接输入回答；超时或取消时请求交回 Harness。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2026-2215","index.js:2948-2970"]}
{"unit_id":"pingmike2__dsh-telegram-control#feature-plugin_ops","repo":"pingmike2/dsh-telegram-control","commit":"8b8c60df33b3612dd6ce0b320c22f03aca4b051c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-telegram-control 的功能「插件管理」：通过 /plugins 和 /bundles 查看列表，使用 /plugin 启停插件、/install 安装 bundle 或 /uninstall 移除 bundle。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2972-2985","index.js:3580-3660"]}
